    <h1>Getting Started with FxTune</h1>

    <p>
      FxTune is a platinum-grade mobile DAW powered by AI. This documentation covers the
      architecture, DSP engine, and AI systems that make FxTune possible.
    </p>

    <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Android device with API level 26+ (Android 8.0 Oreo)</li>
      <li>ARM64 processor with NEON SIMD support</li>
      <li>Minimum 4GB RAM for neural inference</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Quick Links</h2>
