    <h2>System Overview</h2>
    <p>FxTune is built on three pillars:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>C++ Native Engine</strong> — Real-time audio processing with AAudio MMAP, ARM NEON SIMD,
        and lock-free data structures
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Jetpack Compose UI</strong> — 60/120fps glassmorphism interface with state hoisting and
        isolated recomposition
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>GhostHand AI</strong> — Neural audio coaching with genre-aware preset synthesis
      </li>
    </ol>
